00:36:49.800 --> 00:36:50.840
I haven't thought about that.

00:36:50.840 --> 00:36:53.700
So that manipulation could
be misunderstood. All right.

00:36:53.700 --> 00:36:58.700
So these are just a few of the
banners that we found online,

00:36:59.150 --> 00:37:03.060
but this is widely publicized
all across Colombia

00:37:03.060 --> 00:37:04.870
in the last presidential elections.

00:37:04.870 --> 00:37:06.850
And then another thing
that I wanted to show you

00:37:06.850 --> 00:37:11.710
was is it true that maybe
the majority of the voters

00:37:11.710 --> 00:37:13.300
in Colombia have these fears

00:37:13.300 --> 00:37:15.180
because maybe it's just a
minority or maybe they see

00:37:15.180 --> 00:37:17.810
the banners that they don't believe it.

00:37:17.810 --> 00:37:21.640
But here I'm just showing
you more, let's say anecdotal

00:37:21.640 --> 00:37:24.680
or maybe some evidence of the fact

00:37:24.680 --> 00:37:26.690
that there is a large
majority of Colombians

00:37:26.690 --> 00:37:28.610
who actually think this is true.

00:37:28.610 --> 00:37:32.100
So Invamer Marisa a statistical firm,

00:37:32.100 --> 00:37:34.170
a firm that collect surveys in Colombia

00:37:34.170 --> 00:37:36.470
and they do a survey
that is representative

00:37:36.470 --> 00:37:39.630
of the majority of Colombian
voters, 96% of the voters.

00:37:39.630 --> 00:37:41.140
It's not a representative
at the municipal level,

00:37:41.140 --> 00:37:43.540
and this is why we can't use it

00:37:43.540 --> 00:37:45.240
to run a statistical analysis

00:37:45.240 --> 00:37:49.010
but at least we can kind of
try to see using the data

00:37:49.010 --> 00:37:51.690
that is collected there
to answer this question.

00:37:51.690 --> 00:37:53.750
Is it true that many
Colombians think this is true?

00:37:53.750 --> 00:37:58.440
So the question that
is from us was Colombia

00:37:58.440 --> 00:38:00.430
might be in the same
situation as Venezuela

00:38:00.430 --> 00:38:01.300
in the near future.

00:38:01.300 --> 00:38:03.640
Do you think that's true? Yes or no?

00:38:03.640 --> 00:38:06.390
And you can see that the
green line would show you

00:38:06.390 --> 00:38:09.060
the share of respondents
who actually thought

00:38:09.060 --> 00:38:11.040
this was a possibility that Colombia

00:38:11.040 --> 00:38:12.780
might be calming itself.

00:38:12.780 --> 00:38:13.890
