00:39:34.798 --> 00:39:37.346
I mean, it's just a really
difficult problem to solve.

00:39:37.346 --> 00:39:39.350
- Oh yeah. I totally agree with you.

00:39:39.350 --> 00:39:41.900
They have probably go hand-in-hand.

00:39:41.900 --> 00:39:43.290
