00:43:23.580 --> 00:43:25.920
the fears are very
strong about the effects

00:43:25.920 --> 00:43:30.593
that other the left
could have in Colombia.

00:43:33.230 --> 00:43:38.230
So to kind of wrap up my
presentation, what we observe here

00:43:38.870 --> 00:43:42.070
is that the large migration
inflows from Venezuela

00:43:42.070 --> 00:43:46.040
